From: incari-client <335801235+incari-client@users.noreply.github.com>
Date: Fri, 9 Oct 2026 21:17:45 -0400
Subject: [PATCH] client: Show the player beside the title screen's buttons

The title screen's Edit Profile link in the top left corner gives way to
the player's model, their name over their head and an Edit Profile button
below, to the right of the main buttons (Incari's TitleProfile).

diff --git a/src/main/java/net/minecraft/client/gui/screens/TitleScreen.java b/src/main/java/net/minecraft/client/gui/screens/TitleScreen.java
index dad2ab9b13f8b43cc938fbb88efbf80f355c326e..ee7507fe31820c1e07a621f6e2d98d8714ac6722 100644
--- a/src/main/java/net/minecraft/client/gui/screens/TitleScreen.java
+++ b/src/main/java/net/minecraft/client/gui/screens/TitleScreen.java
@@ -160,4 +160,4 @@
         );
-        // Incari start: a link to Edit Profile (the name and skin)
-        this.addRenderableWidget(incari.client.profile.ProfileScreen.titleLink(this));
+        // Incari start: the player, beside the buttons, and Edit Profile (the name and skin)
+        incari.client.profile.TitleProfile.add(this, this::addRenderableWidget);
         // Incari end
